            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-secondary-fg leading-relaxed">
              Turn happy customers into high-converting video proof. Trigger automatic WhatsApp/SMS review requests after successful orders or resolved tickets, and sync 5-star ratings directly to Google Business, Yelp, and your website.
