            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground pt-2">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="p-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400"><Icon name="check" class="w-3 h-3" /></span>
                <span>Frictionless browser-based 60s video testimonial collector</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="p-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400"><Icon name="check" class="w-3 h-3" /></span>
