            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
              Orchestrate any revenue workflow with visual triggers.
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-secondary-fg leading-relaxed">
              Connect customer actions to multi-step logic without code. If a high-value lead messages on WhatsApp, trigger an AI qualification check, create a pipeline deal, and alert your senior executive on Slack.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground pt-2">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="p-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400"><Icon name="check" class="w-3 h-3" /></span>
                <span>Visual node-based canvas for branching logic & time delays</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="p-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400"><Icon name="check" class="w-3 h-3" /></span>
                <span>Integrates with webhooks, Stripe billing events & custom APIs</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <span class="p-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400"><Icon name="check" class="w-3 h-3" /></span>
